<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan increases prices of oil products.</title>
<headline>Pakistan increases prices of oil products.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's caretaker government raised the prices of oil products for the third time in two months, newspapers reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The official news agency APP quoted a spokesman at the Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Resources as saying the adjustment was in line with changes in international prices.</p>
<p>Prices (in rupees per litre)</p>
<p> PRODUCT				 NEW     OLD     INCREASE (pct)</p>
<p> Petrol (regular)		    17.23   16.81   0.42</p>
<p> Petrol (super/premium plus)     18.354  17.922  0.432</p>
<p> High octane blending component  20.04   19.59   0.45</p>
<p> Kerosene oil			  10.08    9.74   0.34</p>
<p> High speed diesel		   10.27    9.93   0.34</p>
<p> Light diesel oil		     8.36    8.08   0.28</p>
<p> JP-1				     8.78    8.31   0.47</p>
<p> JP-4				    10.47    9.90   0.57</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
